    "name": {
      "value": "Elemental Wayfinder (Water)"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lopsg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Pathfinder Society researchers recently created elemental wayfinders with the assistance of the Society's elemental allies. In addition to the effects of a wayfinder, these wayfinders each grant the ability to cast a particular elemental spell once per day, and can assist Pathfinders in exploring areas associated with their element. Each has the trait associated with its element.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n\nThe wayfinder casts its associated spell.\n\nThe wayfinder can cast 4th-level hydraulic torrent.\n\nAdditionally, you gain the constant effects of water breathing."
    },
